<h1>Computer Science</h1>

<section>
    <p>In this course, you will learn the fundamentals of programming, computational thinking, and the theory of information science (including some introductory data science). We will also be learning a little about computer systems, particularly how to navigate file systems, different file types, and how to use the command line to access the programs and other files on your computer.</p>
